.SH NAME
omorfos\-wallpaper \- The wallpaper of the omorfos desktop: a picture or a colour behind the windows of each screen
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBomorfos\-wallpaper\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
The omorfos compositor starts it, as \fBwallpaper\fR in config.yaml says.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
Print this help
.TP
\fB\-V, \-\-version\fR
Print the version
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBomorfos\fR(1), \fBomorfosctl\fR(1), \fBomorfos\-config\fR(5), \fBomorfos\-keys\fR(5), \fBomorfos\-rules\fR(5), \fBomorfos\-menu\fR(5), \fBomorfos\-theme\fR(5)
